> I want to start a new conlang (a Toki Pona derivative).
>

I don't think this is the place to be talking about this. I'm certain there
are conlang groups/forums/what-have-you in existence. Those are the proper
venues for this discussion, not here. This group is for specifically for
matters relating to Lojban.

