<gleki.is.my.name@gmail.com>wrote:

> If you are thinking of buying a server note that i'm thinking about that
> too (but for lojban).... (I dont want to be the only person that is in
> charge of such important project as lojban).
>

Why? Lojban *has* a server. Duplication of effort is a waste of time.
Further, *you* are not in charge of Lojban, Robin Powell is. And since his
position is "Benevolent Dictator for Life", you will probably *never* be in
charge.

